  "script": "I wanna sell my house. But do I list it... or take a cash offer?\n\nTwo Homies. Same house. Let's find out.\n\nListing Homie fixes up everything first. Whoa, whoa, whoa!\n\nThen he pays agent fees. Around five and a half percent of the price.\n\nAnd he waits. About forty-two days to close with a mortgage.\n\nBut he usually gets the higher price.\n\nCash Homie sells as-is. No repairs. No showings.\n\nThe offer is lower, but he can close in one to three weeks.\n\nNeed top dollar and have time? List it. Need speed, or the house needs work? Get a cash offer. Smartest move? Compare both.\n\nIf Homie can sell it, so can you.",
